VAR name = ""

-> main

=== main ===
Hello, Whats your name?
    * [My name is Bruh]
        ~ name = "Bruh"
        Your name is {name}
        -> main
    * [My name is Drudt]
        ~ name = "Drudt"
        Your name is {name}
        -> main
    * [My name is Gorga]
        ~ name = "Gorga"
        Your name is {name}
        -> main
    
    
    === Chosen ===
    Your name is {name}
    -> END